  <data name="Cli.Help" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Date Countdown command line

Usage:
  datecountdown add --title &lt;text&gt; --at &lt;timestamp&gt; [--timezone &lt;id&gt;] [--request-id &lt;id&gt;] [--json]

Options:
  --title       Countdown title (up to 80 characters).
  --at          RFC 3339 timestamp with an explicit UTC offset.
  --timezone    Optional IANA or Windows time-zone identifier.
  --request-id  Optional 32-digit hexadecimal id; repeating it never creates a duplicate.
  --json        Write a machine-readable result.

Example:
  datecountdown add --title "Submit report" --at "2026-08-01T17:00:00+08:00" --timezone "Asia/Shanghai"</value>
  </data>
